title: "high-precision-glioma-segmentation"
abstract: >
  Reproducible pipeline for high-precision segmentation of glioma and
  surroundings using multiparametric MRI, FreeSurfer 8.2.0 SynthSeg/SynthSR,
  fastMONAI, and nnU-Net v2, with regional tumor-burden (Hit-Plot)
  visualisation.
